Simplenote for HarmonyOS
========================

This project is an unofficial HarmonyOS (ArkTS / ArkUI) port of Simplenote for
iOS, the Simplenote client for iPhone and iPad by Automattic and its
contributors.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Automattic/simplenote-ios
Upstream base:    release 4.55 (build 4.55.0.4)

