Please do not report problems with this port to the upstream project.
"Simplenote" and the Simplenote logo are trademarks of Automattic Inc.; the
GPLv2 covers the source code, not that name or that artwork.


Services
--------

Notes are synchronised with Simperium (https://simperium.com), the sync
service Simplenote uses. The port ships with the same public demo Simperium
application id and key as the upstream repository's SPCredentials-demo.swift.
Production Simplenote features that depend on Automattic's servers
(publishing a note, collaboration, WordPress.com login) do not work with those
demo credentials, exactly as upstream documents for its development builds.


